::JOUR_U06_L05_QUIZ_Q01::[MLA.JOUR.DIG.02] Source: Multimedia Package Preparation. Task: The newsroom is preparing a final multimedia package about the new student garden. Required parts: a short digital presentation with three findings, a five-image sequence showing the planting process, one accurate feature photo, and a 20-second video clip with natural sound. Audience: students, families, and community partners. Production Concern: the image sequence currently starts with the finished garden before showing the planting steps, and the feature photo shows last year's garden sign. Publication Need: the package must use logical sequence, accurate visuals, and clear presentation choices before the final portfolio. Question: Question 1: Which answer best applies the lesson standard to the embedded final-package source? {
